{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become President. Change the nation\u2014or make it yours.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You are the newly elected President of the United States.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >America in 2025 is tearing itself apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ideological divides are deeper than ever.<br>People with opposing values no longer understand\u2014let alone tolerate\u2014each other.<br>Post-pandemic inflation and sky-high housing prices have crushed an entire generation.<br>Allies are greedy. Rivals circle like vultures. The public\u2019s trust is fading fast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They elected you to fix this mess.<br>But how will you answer their expectations?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is eight years enough to rebuild America?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The U.S. Constitution limits you to two terms.<br>Can you restore the economy, calm the public, and eliminate your opponents in that time?<br>Or will you take a more... radical approach:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change the law and extend your term in the name of \u201csaving the nation\u201d?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seize control of media and the military to turn the republic into your personal empire?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or perhaps\u2014shed the illusions of democracy and take full control, all in the name of order?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\udde0 Deep Political Simulation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the White House. Let me walk you through how the machine works:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6 Domestic Power Manipulation:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Congress</strong>: Elected by the people, yes\u2014but loyal to money and threats. Bribe them. Blackmail them. Your call.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Capitalists</strong>: They can fund you or serve you\u2014if you\u2019re smart enough to use them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Military Commanders</strong>: Loyalty is everything. Reward them well. When push comes to shove, no law is stronger than a bullet.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Federal Reserve Chair</strong>: Independent in name. But will they dare defy you when it\u2019s time to slash rates and pump liquidity?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Propaganda System</strong>: Win hearts and minds\u2014or flood them with fear until they obey.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6 Foreign Trade &amp; Diplomacy:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The global order is for sale</strong>: Use diplomacy or military pressure to squeeze economic concessions from allies and silence domestic dissent.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Divide and Conquer</strong>: Fan international tensions. Fuel foreign wars. Reap the rewards while others bleed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Abandon all ideals</strong>: Rebrand your personal enrichment as \u201cnational interest.\u201d If it\u2019s well-packaged, no one will ask questions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\uddfd System Highlights</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hyper-Realistic Simulation</strong>: Driven by data from hundreds of millions of virtual citizens, grounded in modern political and economic theory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10+ Interwoven Systems</strong>: Legislation, propaganda, monetary policy, diplomacy, military operations, blackmail networks\u2014tightly linked, dangerously fragile.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Opinion-Shaping Tools</strong>: Reshape beliefs through TV, internet, textbooks, exams, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Full Chain of Power</strong>: Economy \u2192 Public Opinion \u2192 Congress \u2192 Law \u2192 Military \u2192 Intelligence \u2192 Media\u2014all at your fingertips.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Card-Based Negotiation</strong>: Engage in covert deals using threats, bribes, promises, and leverage cards to dominate the political arena.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cascading Crisis System</strong>: Every choice can trigger strikes, scandals, regime changes, diplomatic meltdowns\u2014there\u2019s no safe path.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2753 You are the President, the player, and the puppet master.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you become a hero of the people\u2014or a dictator for the history books?<br>Will you surrender power\u2014or replace the flag with your own face?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>But can you truly resist the temptation of power?</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choice is yours.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3677060?t=1764858194","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3677060?t=1764858194","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677060/0f0e81ca663613743301c8a7ef13971dae0fc2ec/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764858194","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677060/0f0e81ca663613743301c8a7ef13971dae0fc2ec/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764858194","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become President. Change the nation\u2014or make it yours.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You are the newly elected President of the United States.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Am